Package: openmiop-dkms
Version: @DEBVERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: roysbike <roysbike@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: dkms, iproute2, kmod
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/roysbike/pcie-ep-net
Description: openmiop: Ethernet over the Mixtile Cluster Box PCIe fabric (DKMS)
 Kernel module for the Mixtile Blade 3 (RK3588): the PCIe3 controller
 fe150000 becomes a PCIe endpoint on the Cluster Box fabric and the
 blade gets the network interface omi0 (OpenMIOP protocol v4).
 Built by DKMS for the running kernel (6.1 or newer with its headers).
 openmiop.service brings up omi0 with the address in /etc/openmiop.addr.
